WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:08.830
Reflect briefly on the varying friendships,
relationships, and social groups that you

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:10.389
are a part of.

00:00:10.389 --> 00:00:17.130
Consider how different they are, person-to-person,
group-to-group, and how your own personality

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:22.270
often changes depending on whom you are with.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:26.040
This is because humans are socially echoic.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:32.360
We conform our behavior to echo the behavior
of those around us.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:39.309
Each social encounter we engage in carries
with it its own unique character; a weighted

00:00:39.309 --> 00:00:43.719
average of all the personalities involved.

00:00:43.719 --> 00:00:50.280
We are merely actors, constantly playing different
roles to suit the different scenes we enter

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.329
in life.

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:59.050
Our ability to adapt to and reflect these
shared scenes and personalities is what allows

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:05.299
us to experience successful friendships and
relationships.

00:01:05.299 --> 00:01:11.250
What we must careful of, though, is what scenes
we choose to enter.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:15.729
We must be selective with who we surround
ourselves with.

00:01:15.729 --> 00:01:22.759
We must be aware of how like-minded and mutually
valuable our friends and partners are to us.

00:01:22.759 --> 00:01:29.350
If not, we risk losing sight of our core self
and what we stand for.

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:34.899
We risk reducing our intellect and values.

00:01:34.899 --> 00:01:40.729
The saying that a team is only as a strong
as their weakest link is very much applicable

00:01:40.729 --> 00:01:45.270
to the science of human sociality.

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:52.000
Therefore, we should strive to have a balance
of relationships that challenge and support

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.600
us.

00:01:53.600 --> 00:02:00.010
Like childhood bullies suffering from insecurity,
people love to bring the world down to their

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.729
level so they don’t feel quite so alone.

00:02:03.729 --> 00:02:07.450
Don’t let these people infect you.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:15.380
You have the privileged ability to choose
who you spend time with in life.

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.500
Choose wisely.

